            <div xml:id="d355-a1-a5">

                <pb facs="0684" n="624" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg624"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <p rendition="#center">GOVERNMENT OF NEW LEON.—NO. 26.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to reply to the dispatch from your department of the 11th
                    instant, asking information of the events of the 21st of April last, in this
                    city, in reference to the alleged maltreatment of American citizens on that
                    night. The account you ask for will be forwarded by next mail. Your
                    communication has been transmitted to the chief justice of the State court.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Independence and liberty!
                            <placeName>Monterey</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1868-08-23">23d of August, 1868</date>,</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>G. TREVIÑO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Carlos F. Ayala</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Chief Official.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister of Foreign Affairs</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Mexico.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
